## Interfaces

### `DocPage`
```typescript
export interface DocPage {
  id: string;
  title: string;
  description: string;
  route: string;
  icon?: string;
  children?: DocPage[];
}
```

Used by `DocLayoutComponent` to render the sidebar navigation and by `DocsLandingComponent` for doc category cards.

### `DocSection`
```typescript
export interface DocSection {
  heading: string;
  content: string;
  code?: string;
}
```

### `FaqItem`
```typescript
export interface FaqItem {
  question: string;
  answer: string;
}
```

Used by `FaqComponent` to render the accordion FAQ list.

### Location
`src/app/models/doc-pagemodel.model.ts`
